          <article class="card">
            <h3>U.S. return for Canadian residents</h3>
            <p>Form 1040 or 1040-NR for Canadian-resident clients with U.S. citizenship, income or property.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Foreign tax credits and treaty positions</h3>
            <p>Form 1116 and T2209 so the same income isn&rsquo;t taxed twice, and Form 8833 where a treaty position needs disclosing.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Foreign account and asset reporting</h3>
            <p>FBAR (FinCEN 114), Form 8938 and T1135: the forms people most often miss.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Cross-border review</h3>
            <p>A second look at a return you&rsquo;ve prepared, with written notes on anything to change.</p>
